  {"id":"daily-phrases-1-30","startTime":237.72,"endTime":247.4,"text":"If I had the choice, I'd work fewer hours, and have more time for exercise, reading, and other things I enjoy.","words":[{"text":"If","startTime":237.78,"endTime":237.92},{"text":"I","startTime":237.92,"endTime":238.01},{"text":"had","startTime":238.01,"endTime":238.31},{"text":"the","startTime":238.31,"endTime":238.62},{"text":"choice,","startTime":238.62,"endTime":239.05},{"text":"I'd","startTime":239.42,"endTime":239.72},{"text":"work","startTime":239.72,"endTime":240.12},{"text":"fewer","startTime":240.12,"endTime":240.62},{"text":"hours,","startTime":240.62,"endTime":240.98},{"text":"and","startTime":241.36,"endTime":241.62},{"text":"have","startTime":241.62,"endTime":242.01},{"text":"more","startTime":242.06,"endTime":242.42},{"text":"time","startTime":242.42,"endTime":242.82},{"text":"for","startTime":242.82,"endTime":243.12},{"text":"exercise,","startTime":243.12,"endTime":243.78},{"text":"reading,","startTime":244.12,"endTime":244.78},{"text":"and","startTime":245.11,"endTime":245.39},{"text":"other","startTime":245.43,"endTime":245.48},{"text":"things","startTime":245.48,"endTime":246.24},{"text":"I","startTime":246.24,"endTime":246.36},{"text":"enjoy.","startTime":246.36,"endTime":246.81}]},
  {"id":"daily-phrases-1-31","startTime":247.4,"endTime":256.08,"text":"I prefer learning new skills at my own pace, because I can take the time to understand things properly.","words":[{"text":"I","startTime":247.48,"endTime":247.49},{"text":"prefer","startTime":247.49,"endTime":248.05},{"text":"learning","startTime":248.05,"endTime":248.8},{"text":"new","startTime":248.8,"endTime":249.04},{"text":"skills","startTime":249.1,"endTime":249.64},{"text":"at","startTime":249.64,"endTime":249.82},{"text":"my","startTime":249.82,"endTime":250},{"text":"own","startTime":250,"endTime":250.28},{"text":"pace,","startTime":250.28,"endTime":250.6},{"text":"because","startTime":250.83,"endTime":251.48},{"text":"can","startTime":251.57,"endTime":251.85},{"text":"take","startTime":251.85,"endTime":252.17},{"text":"the","startTime":252.26,"endTime":252.41},{"text":"time","startTime":252.57,"endTime":252.87},{"text":"to","startTime":252.87,"endTime":253.05},{"text":"understand","startTime":253.05,"endTime":254.08},{"text":"things","startTime":254.08,"endTime":254.78},{"text":"properly.","startTime":254.78,"endTime":255.28}]},
